ía para que cada paso se sienta ligero y fluido.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Soporte Estable y Reactivo:<\/strong> 🧠<br\/>Su estructura diseñada con ingeniería suiza se adapta al movimiento natural del pie, brindando <strong>seguridad, equilibrio y confort total<\/strong> en cualquier terreno.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Ventilación de Alto Nivel:<\/strong> 💨<br\/>El upper de malla técnica permite una circulación constante del aire, manteniendo tus pies <strong>frescos y secos<\/strong> incluso en actividades intensas o climas cálidos.<br\/><\/li><li><strong>Estilo Moderno y Rendimiento Premium:<\/strong> ☁️<br\/>Perfectos para correr, caminar o usar diariamente. Combinan <strong>tecnología, diseño minimalista y versatilidad<\/strong>, logrando ese look limpio y deportivo que distingue a los On Cloud.<br\/><\/li><\/ul>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_MLETE9","text_RKH4KC"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/Creación_GIF_Publicitario_On_Cloud_Horizon.mp4","video_autoplay":true,"video_loop":true,"height":"adapt","color_scheme":"background-1","section_color_scheme":"background-1","full_desktop_width":false,"content_layout":"no-overlap","desktop_media_width":50,"layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_full_media_width":true,"mobile_direction":"normal","mobile_image_quanlity":"2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","mobile_padding_top":0,"mobile_padding_bottom":16,"desktop_padding_top":36,"desktop_padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#2e2a39","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_outline_button":"#dd1d1d","custom_section_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_section_gradient_background":""}},"related-products":{"type":"related-products","disabled":true,"setting